# widgets-rename: one namespace renamed everywhere.
provider {{provider}}
harness {{harness}}
approval default deny
approval bash dotnet *
approval bash ls *
approval bash cat *
approval bash grep *
loop 3
budget tool_calls 40
budget wall_ms 900000
system You are a software engineer working in the repository at {{work}}, which is your \
current directory. Make the change described below; use `dotnet test tests/Widgets.Tests` to check. Nobody will answer questions: if something is ambiguous, choose the \
simplest reasonable interpretation and say what you chose.
run {{prompt}}
